        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "4d3d7ba5-bc69-5419-bb68-49fadcecc10f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: El Chavo, El Chavo Animado, El Chavo del Ocho\n- Companies: Kaxan Media Group, Slang Publishing, Televisa Home Entertainment\n- People: Roberto Gómez Bolaños\n- Places: Mexico, Brazil\n- Topics: video games, animated series, live-action TV series\n\nFacts:\n- El Chavo Animado is a Mexican animated series also known as El Chavo: The Animated Series.\n- Roberto Gómez Bolaños created El Chavo del Ocho and also created the related animated series El Chavo Animado.\n- El Chavo Animado is based on the live-action TV series El Chavo del Ocho.\n- El Chavo is a party video game based on the Mexican TV series El Chavo Animado.\n- Kaxan Media Group developed the video game El Chavo.\n- Slang Publishing and Televisa Home Entertainment published the video game El Chavo.\n- El Chavo was released only in Mexico and Brazil for the Wii on April 27, 2012.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
